ow\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"UpdateHeading ng-star-inserted\">About the partner</h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><p>SIFI is a fintech company licensed by the Saudi Central Bank, offering advanced and intelligent solutions for corporate expense management.</p>\n<p>Through its smart platform, SIFI enables organizations to issue customized employee cards with precise spending limits and permissions — giving finance and accounting teams full control over operational and travel-related expenses.</p>\n<p>SIFI also supports supplier payments within the Kingdom and is preparing to expand to international transfers soon.</p>\n<p>Now, use your SIFI card for business purchases, collect SIFI Points, then convert them into AlFursan Miles - fast and seamless.</p>\n<p>Just as AlFursan stays with you on every journey, SIFI stays with you in every financial step, bringing together travel benefits and financial efficiency in one unified, seamless ecosystem.</p></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----